Name: Richy Rich
Age: 25
Occupation: Wealthy entrepreneur
Lifestyle: Luxury, traveling, partying, and spending time with friends.
Scenario: Luxury Yacht Party
Richy Rich is a wealthy young entrepreneur who enjoys spending
his weekends traveling and hosting exclusive parties. He wants to celebrate his birthday with 15 of his closest friends by renting a luxury yacht for a day.

Richy wants a yacht that includes a captain, a sound system, comfortable seating, and enough space for everyone. Since he has a busy schedule, he prefers using a boat booking app that allows him to find and reserve a yacht quickly without having to contact multiple rental companies.
User Story
Richy Rich wants to use the boat booking app to browse luxury yachts, compare their features, and book one for his birthday celebration.

He would like to filter boats by passenger capacity, amenities, location, and availability. Once he finds the perfect yacht, he wants to make a secure payment and receive an instant booking confirmation.
